% Each entry below MUST be verified by the author before the v1.2
% release tag.  Verification = the entry's title, authors, journal,
% year, volume/pages, and DOI all match a check against the
% publisher's record (or a trusted database: Crossref, DOI.org,
% the publisher's own page).  When verified, append a comment line
% `% @verified <date> <initials>` after the closing brace of the
% entry.
%
% Unverified entries are flagged `% @verified 2026-05-11 QQ` and MUST NOT be
